      "reason": "The title explicitly includes the phrase \"rapid review and meta-analysis,\" which identifies the report as a systematic review."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_1_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "Bacterial co-infection and secondary infection in patients with COVID19: a living rapid review and meta-analysis",
